/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#Pointer-shape-and-content-effects","line":37},{"title":"Pointer accessories","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#Pointer-accessories","line":77},{"title":"`UIPointerAccessory`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIPointerAccessory","line":81},{"title":"Pointer magnetism","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#Pointer-magnetism","line":87},{"title":"Standard pointers and effects","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#Standard-pointers-and-effects","line":105},{"title":"Customizing pointers","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#Customizing-pointers","line":113},{"title":"An illustration of a button that has a filled, rounded-rectangle bezel. The button is centered on top of a shaded rectangle that extends beyond the button by the same distance on all sides. Centered on each side, a callout indicates that the padding between the button and each edge of the shaded rectangle is 12 points.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3993cfe0b8ec1f79e7c27496d92b240e/padding-for-button-with-bezel%402x.png","line":122,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a symbol centered on top of a shaded rectangle that extends beyond the symbol by the same distance on all sides. Centered on each side, a callout indicates that the padding between the symbol and each edge of the shaded rectangle is 24 points.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/58bee8289c0508cc5b9e83f030925cb6/padding-for-glyph%402x.png","line":124,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a button without a bezel, centered on top of a shaded rectangle that extends beyond the button by the same distance on all sides. Centered on each side, a callout indicates that the padding between the button and each edge of the shaded rectangle is 24 points.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5a79ca3d0a9d4bbd3bf71c23bf8c5da3/padding-for-button-without-bezel%402x.png","line":126,"embedded":true},{"title":"`UIPointerShape.roundedRect(_:radius:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIPointerShape-swift.enum/roundedRect\\(_:radius:\\","line":130},{"title":"Customizing pointers","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#Customizing-pointers","line":132},{"title":"An illustration of a custom pointer hovering over a resize handle on the edge of a shaded rectangle. Above the pointer is a small annotation that displays the image’s width and height values against a dark background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/291aebad59eee8712e94047fcca4e7cf/useful-pointer-annotation%402x.png","line":144,"embedded":true},{"title":"macOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#macOS","line":150},{"title":"Pointers","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pointing-devices#Pointers","line":173},{"title":"`arrow`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/arrow","line":179},{"title":"A pointer that resembles a diagonal arrow pointing up and to the left.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5be2c381c17d5d868866b3a5de1013f8/pointers-arrow%402x.png","line":179,"embedded":true},{"title":"`closedHand`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/closedHand","line":180},{"title":"A closed, gloved hand.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6680cdb870edf5364f84a483fd2bead9/pointers-closed-hand%402x.png","line":180,"embedded":true},{"title":"`contextualMenu`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSCursor/contextualMenu","line":181},{"title":"A pointer arrow with a small menu-like square to